{
  "name": "Kono.ai — Gmail Desatendido & Auto-Fetch de Facturas",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        },
        "simple": false,
        "filters": {
          "q": "has:attachment (filename:pdf OR filename:png OR filename:jpg OR subject:factura OR subject:invoice)"
        },
        "options": {
          "downloadAttachments": true
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmailTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        300
      ],
      "id": "node-gmail-trigger",
      "name": "Gmail Trigger (Vigilante de Facturas)"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://kono-app:80/api/v1/inbound/webhook",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-Kono-Webhook-Secret",
              "value": "kono_secret_key_2026"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "multipart-form-data",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "parameterType": "formBinaryData",
              "name": "file",
              "inputDataFieldName": "attachment_0"
            },
            {
              "name": "source_tag",
              "value": "gmail_n8n_automated"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        300
      ],
      "id": "node-forward-to-kono",
      "name": "Despachar a Kono.ai (Port 80)"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "addLabels",
        "messageId": "={{ $json.id }}",
        "labelIds": [
          "PROCESADO_KONO"
        ]
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        740,
        300
      ],
      "id": "node-mark-as-processed",
      "name": "Marcar Correo Procesado"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📧 Kono.ai — Flujo 100% Desatendido de Gmail\n1. **Gmail Trigger:** Vigila la bandeja y detecta correos con adjuntos PDF/PNG/Facturas cada minuto.\n2. **Extracción Binaria:** Descarga el archivo adjunto en memoria automáticamente.\n3. **Forwarding a Kono:** Envía el archivo vía HTTP POST autenticado al motor de auditoría.\n4. **Etiquetado:** Marca el correo como 'PROCESADO_KONO' para evitar reprocesamiento.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 420
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        40
      ],
      "id": "node-note-gmail-doc",
      "name": "Documentación del Flujo"
    }
  ],
  "pinData": {},
  "connections": {
    "Gmail Trigger (Vigilante de Facturas)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Despachar a Kono.ai (Port 80)",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Despachar a Kono.ai (Port 80)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Marcar Correo Procesado",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": true,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "versionId": "2.0.0",
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": true,
    "instanceId": "kono-n8n-instance"
  }
}
